.TH KAPTAN 1 "November 2026" "kaptan 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
kaptan \- Linux system optimizer and monitor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kaptan
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B kaptan
is a graphical system optimizer and monitor, a Rust and Slint port of Stacer.
It shows CPU, memory, disk, network and GPU usage with history charts, manages
processes, systemd services, startup applications, installed packages, APT
repositories and /etc/hosts, and cleans package caches, logs, crash reports,
application caches and the trash.
.PP
Actions that need root privileges (services, packages, repositories, hosts,
cleaning system files) ask for authorization through
.BR pkexec (1).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/kaptan/settings.json
User settings: language, theme, start page, dashboard disk, usage alerts.
.TP
.I ~/.config/autostart/kaptan.desktop
Created when "Start Kaptan at login" is enabled.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B LANGUAGE, LC_ALL, LC_MESSAGES, LANG
Select the interface language when the language setting is "System default".
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pkexec (1),
.BR systemctl (1),
.BR nvidia-smi (1)
